    "blurb": "Access metadata and run processes",
    "overview": "Connect Camunda with Automic Automation to start jobs, get metadata, and route process paths based on execution status for reliable automation across systems.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Bridge Camunda and Automic Automation",
    "splashDescription": "The Automic connector links Camunda and Automic Automation so Automic capabilities can be invoked directly within Camunda-based business processes. Use Camunda as the orchestration layer while Automic handles job and workflow automation to support end-to-end automation across system boundaries. From a service task, you can start existing Automic workflows and read metadata from Automic objects such as jobs and workflows. Retrieved metadata is captured as JSON in Camunda process variables, making it easy to reuse for decisions, validations, and audit-friendly logging. This reduces manual steps, helps standardize integrations, and improves automation consistency for both developers and process modelers.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/759469/overview/img5333174131749705714.png?85992912bb933863a06273a23fe535ab",
